3: /// <summary>
4: /// TR-MCP-USECASE-018 (AC-006), TR-MCP-USECASE-019 (AC-008): binds <see cref="UnitSuitePlatformScanner"/>,
5: /// unchanged from its mock gate, to the C# sources of every project the Nuke <c>Test</c> target runs
6: /// (<c>build/Build.Test.cs</c>: test projects except integration, plugin-integration, review and Build.Tests
7: /// projects). A test that depends on the platform is an integration test, so the unit test classes hold
8: /// no operating-system check, OS-platform attribute, xUnit skip, or real process-host binding.
9: /// </summary>
